/**
 * @defgroup Macros _sys-sage_'s Public Macros
 *
 * @brief Public preprocessor macros provided by _sys-sage_.
 *
 * This group contains the documented preprocessor macros that
 * form part of the public sys-sage API.
 *
 * The macros are grouped here independently of the header files
 * in which they are defined, providing a single entry point for
 * users looking for compile-time configuration and API macros.
 */
